# the same calls with unboxed numbers withheld: each goes by its row. The row of Boolean converts its argument itself, so the conversion stands there, and the call stays behind it
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=none+DirectCalls+BuiltinCalls+TypedOperations
# CHECK-LABEL: code f1:Body
# CHECK: = Call
# RUN(TRUTH): walk f2 mechanisms=none+DirectCalls+BuiltinCalls+TypedOperations
# TRUTH-LABEL: code f2:Body
# TRUTH: = ToBoolean
# TRUTH: = CallBuiltin {{*}}overload=Boolean/0
# RUN(NEVER): walk f1 mechanisms=none+DirectCalls+BuiltinCalls+TypedOperations
# NEVER-NOT: = ToNumber
# PROGRAM-OF: number-string-and-boolean-called-are-the-conversions.ir
